========================================================================
  PRACTICAL UNLABELING TOOLS
  opus-2026-03-22-S174
========================================================================

TOOL 1: FAST STRUCTURAL FINGERPRINT — O(n²)
------------------------------------------------------------

  n=5: 12 distinct fingerprints (vs 12 iso classes)
  Time: 0.02s for all 1024 tournaments

  ✓ FINGERPRINT PERFECTLY DISTINGUISHES ALL ISO CLASSES!
  The O(n²) fingerprint is as good as the O(n!) canonical form.


TOOL 2: SCORE-BASED H PREDICTOR — O(n)
------------------------------------------------------------

  SCORE-BASED H PREDICTION AT n=5:

            scores  predicted         actual H  exact   error
  ────────────────  ─────────  ───────────────  ─────  ──────
   (0, 1, 2, 3, 4)          1              [1]      ✓     0.0
   (0, 1, 3, 3, 3)          3              [3]      ✓     0.0
   (0, 2, 2, 2, 4)          3              [3]      ✓     0.0
   (0, 2, 2, 3, 3)          5              [5]      ✓     0.0
   (1, 1, 1, 3, 4)          3              [3]      ✓     0.0
   (1, 1, 2, 2, 4)          5              [5]      ✓     0.0
